00:09:21,818 --> 00:09:27,818
The Rover is a crime, drama film directed by David Michôd.

3
00:14:02,727 --> 00:14:08,727
Ten years after a severe economic collapse in the western
world, lawlessness reigns and life is cheap.

4
00:18:43,636 --> 00:18:49,636
Eric is a lone drifter, and his car is his only possession.

5
00:23:24,545 --> 00:23:30,545
When a gang steals it, Eric comes across the injured
Rey, left behind by the car thieves.

6
00:28:05,454 --> 00:28:11,454
The pair form an unlikely and uneasy alliance.

7
00:32:46,363 --> 00:32:52,363
Eric, played by Guy Pearce.

8
